				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "We have a tiered dictionary datastructure implemented as a linked list populated from a number of sources, {{gtClass:TTDictionaryTiered|show=comment}}  \n\n{{gtClass:TTVault}} Holds a master copy this data in its store.\n\nTo use the store it must first be converted into a simple dictionary, via #asDictionary, however it is usual to apply a filter inth\n\n"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-11T00:23:38.97928+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-11T00:23:38.97928+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "y2Rs6mwEQduzV96nPlai7A=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Construction\nTiers are built as a simple linked list.\n\n`tdOne appendTier: tdTwo.`\n### Reading\n\nNormal use is read only. For clients we generate a new copy as a normal Dictionary, \nflattening the tiers in reverse order: later tier data is shadowed by earlier tiers.\n \n `td asDictionary at: #foo.`\n\n **For case insensitive use:**\n \n`td asDictionaryWithUppercaseKeys  at: 'FOO'.`\n`td asDictionaryWithLowercaseKeys  at: #foo`.\n### Writing\nWriting only applies to the wrapped dictionary of the frontmost tier. \n \n`td writableDictionary.`\n\nWriting to other tiers is still straightforward.\n\n`(td tierAt: #layer) writableDictionary.`\n### Enabling/Disabling\n This implementation allows for reconfiguring the tiers without dismantling the structure,\n each tier can be individually disabled or re-enabled.\n \n `(td tierAt: ) beDisabled.`"
			},
